cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the method paper listed under
  references and the part you used. Each part carries its own citation
  metadata with its version: python/CITATION.cff for pygeosnag and
  qgis/CITATION.cff for the GeoSnag plugin. This file names the repository
  as a whole.
title: "geosnag: standing dead trees on aerial orthophotos, a Python package and a QGIS plugin"
